====================================================================

This repository ("Theologia Caerulea · 蓝色神学档案馆") is a work of fiction.
All fictional sites, anomalies, and organizations depicted on real-world maps have
no affiliation with any real-world institution, school, hospital, or residence.

All SCP-derived text and composite worldbuilding in this project are licensed under
the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported License (CC BY-SA 3.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/

