Public Domain Mythos Sources:
- Cthulhu, R'lyeh, Yog-Sothoth, Azathoth, Nyarlathotep, Arkham, Innsmouth, Leng, and the
  Antarctic Elder City derive from public-domain works by H. P. Lovecraft (1920–1936).

Original Extensions ("本站原创设定"):
- "Theologia Caerulea / 赫尔墨斯蓝色神学" cross-canon synthesis, Site-01 Alexandria Pharos
  setting, Site-CN-01 Penglai synthesis, original infobox telemetry fields, original fiction
  chapters, and visualization code are released under CC BY-SA 3.0.
